              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle AABBO Waaqi waan jrd'e, Dubbi tiyya ch'aqasa, waan hamtu worri duri lafa tana keesa tau tolche gula indeemina. Ammalle waan akasi suni tokole tolchitani ufi int'ureesina. Anini AABBO Waaqa keesani.",
          "type": "text",
